#Everyday Systems Swap

You have explored how computer systems, connected devices, and AI work together, and you have seen how a student project pulls those ideas into one design. Before you move on, add a short post and see how other teachers connect these ideas to everyday life.

Your post can be a sentence or two. There are no wrong answers.

